{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">馬季今晚煞科。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">未入黑已有不少馬迷，在跑馬地快活谷馬場，下雨亦無阻他們的熱情，趁馬匹「唞暑」放暑假前，把握最後機會入場「夜繽紛」。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.JOCKEY-2000_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026e7vSSgbkv81784122504.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.JOCKEY-2000_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.JOCKEY-2000_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026b9I4Nad7fc1784122515.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.JOCKEY-2000_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">馬場由傍晚六時半起，舉行九場賽事，除了賽馬，現場亦有樂隊及舞者表演，帶動氣氛，晚上更會有煙火匯演及騎師巡遊。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">隨着晚上的賽事結束，馬匹就會「唞暑」，下個馬季九月開鑼。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-15T13:58:53.794290+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}